{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A neon-chrome veneer hides the brutal reality of the city's crime drenched streets. You are &quot;Wire&quot;, the special operative. Hack, rewire and shoot your way through 30+ levels of visceral mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/lvl5_carBarrel.gif?t=1744698884\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chain Reaction Carnage:</strong>\u00a0Rewire your enemies and the environment to daisy chain destruction!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High-Octane Combat:</strong> Move fast, shoot, and use power-ups to take down enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Environmental Hacks:</strong>\u00a0Use the environment against your enemies. Distract and destroy to reach your objective.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/lvl4_shotgunActionLong.gif?t=1744698884\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epic Synthwave Soundtrack:</strong>\u00a0Lose yourself in the cyberpunk soundscape evoking a world of tech and rebellion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Missions:</strong> 40 levels of ever increasing difficulty (5 available in the demo).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Save your Mentor: </strong>Unravel a dark web of deceit and treachery in the neon soaked dystopian city.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/lvl1_carsmash.gif?t=1744698884\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist and join the Discord; keep up to date with the Deadwire experience!</p><p class=\"bb_parag